  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models (e.g., config_031) outperform RNA-only models (config_001). However, uncertainty remains about whether multiprofile settings alone (without multimodal integration) improve performance. This experiment tests RNA-only with multiprofile and scvi_n200 encoder (same as config_031), isolating the effect of multiprofile. It directly compares multiprofile's impact against RNA-only, clarifying whether the benefit comes from multiprofile alone or multimodal integration. This addresses a key design choice (multiprofile vs. singleprofile) with minimal changes, maximizing information gain under budget constraints."  
